@ERRORS.DBG
!%DEBUG-I-VERIFYICF, entering command procedure ERRORS.DBG
! ! ERRORS.DBG - the debugger's messages (docs/PHASE-42.md, subtask 1):
! ! unknown symbols, verbs, keywords, and qualifiers; conflicting
! ! qualifiers; cancelling what isn't set; DCL commands; bad addresses;
! ! what happens at a signal no handler handles with no
! ! SET BREAK/EXCEPTION; and commands after the program has exited.
! !
!%DEBUG-E-NOSYMBOL, symbol 'NOSUCH' is not in the symbol table
!%DEBUG-E-NOSYMBOL, symbol 'NOSUCH' is not in the symbol table
!%DEBUG-E-NOSYMBOL, symbol 'NOSUCH' is not in the symbol table
!%DEBUG-E-SYNTAX, command syntax error at or near 'START'
!%DEBUG-E-SYNTAX, command syntax error at or near 'NOSUCHQUAL'
! CANCEL BREAK FACT
!%DEBUG-I-NOBREAKS, no breakpoints are set
! CANCEL WATCH WATCHL
!%DEBUG-I-NOWATCHES, no watchpoints are set
! CANCEL TRACE FACT
!%DEBUG-I-NOTRACES, no tracepoints are set, no opcode tracing
!%DEBUG-E-SYNTAX, command syntax error at or near 'FOO'
!%DEBUG-E-SYNTAX, command syntax error at or near 'DIRECTORY'
!%DEBUG-E-SYNTAX, command syntax error at or near 'DEFAULT'
!%DEBUG-E-SYNTAX, command syntax error at or near 'DEFAULT'
! STEP/INTO/OVER
!stepped to DBGCMD\START\%LINE 34
!    34:         PUSHL   R2
!%DEBUG-E-SYNTAX, command syntax error at or near 'BOGUS'
!%DEBUG-E-SYNTAX, command syntax error at or near '7'
! EXAMINE/BYTE/WORD WATCHL
!DBGCMD\WATCHL:  0000
!%DEBUG-W-NEEDMORE, unexpected end of command line
! EXAMINE 0
!%DEBUG-E-NOACCESSR, no read access to address 00000000
! EXAMINE 7FFFFFFF
!%DEBUG-E-NOACCESSR, no read access to address 7FFFFFFF
! !
! ! The unhandled signal, then the end of the program.
! GO
!%SYSTEM-W-ENDOFFILE, end of file
!break on unhandled exception preceding DBGCMD\START\%LINE 48
!    48:         PUSHAQ  MSG
! SHOW CALLS
! module name     routine name      line                rel PC           abs PC
!*DBGCMD          START               47               0000005D         0000045D
! GO
!%DEBUG-I-EXITSTATUS, is '%SYSTEM-S-NORMAL, normal successful completion'
! !
! ! After the program has exited.
! GO
!%DEBUG-E-BADSTARTPC, cannot start from PC 00000000
! STEP
!%DEBUG-E-BADSTARTPC, cannot start from PC 00000000
! SHOW CALLS
!%DEBUG-E-NOCALLS, no active call frames
! EXAMINE/INSTRUCTION .PC
!%DEBUG-E-NOACCESSR, no read access to address 00000000
! EXAMINE WATCHL
!DBGCMD\WATCHL:  00000003
!%DEBUG-I-VERIFYICF, exiting command procedure ERRORS.DBG
EXIT
